      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Students can sign up for on-campus accommodation in various housing options and room styles, including double rooms, suites, and apartments. The main residential area is the Christopher Complex, which houses four residence halls: Grosshuesch, Naumann, Buenger, and Schmiechen. Students can opt for a more individual living experience by aiming for apartment-style accommodations on the edge of campus.</p><p>The University's Office of Student Affairs has a list of available online off-campus housing for students who wish to reside nearby.</p>",
